  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Finely chop celery. Roughly chop tomato. Thinly slice silverbeet. Drain the lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61ea0c8bea0c7676e96c66b9/step-fa60a684.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• On a second lined oven tray, place grated Parmesan cheese in even circles to make two per person.\n• Bake until the cheese is golden and crisp around the edges, 6-8 minutes(these can burn fast, so keep an eye on them!). TIP: The Parmesan crisps will crisp up as they cool. TIP: If the Parmesan crisps don't fit on one tray, bake them in batches.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61ea0c8bea0c7676e96c66b9/step-e35bf734.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook celery, stirring occasionally, until slightly softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add tomato paste and garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 30 seconds.\n• Add tomato, the water, garlic & herb seasoning, vegetable stock powder, the butter and brown sugar. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add silverbeet, lentils and roast veggies and continue to simmer until silverbeet has wilted, 1-2 minutes. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61ea0c8bea0c7676e96c66b9/step-bedae651.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie minestrone between bowls.\n• Top with basil pesto and Parmesan crisps to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61ea0c8bea0c7676e96c66b9/step-fcc73c23.jpg"
    }
  ]
